#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000007
msgid "I misjudged you Snake... "
msgstr "我看错你了，SNAKE……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000008
msgid "That's too bad..."
msgstr "太可惜了…"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000009
msgid "You wanna a picture of me?"
msgstr "想拍我的照片？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000a
msgid "I'm ready for my close-up."
msgstr "我准备好拍特写了"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000b
msgid "Make sure you get a good shot of my muscles."
msgstr "记得把我的肌肉拍好看点。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000d
msgid "You're making me blush."
msgstr "你让我脸红了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000e
msgid "Those things don't have X-ray vision, do they?"
msgstr "那些东西没有X光透视吧？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000f
msgid "All right, knock it off."
msgstr "好了，别闹了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000010
msgid "Go ahead, there's plenty of me to see."
msgstr "来吧，我可看的多着呢"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000011
msgid "I've been waiting for you..."
msgstr "我一直在等你……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000012
msgid "Maybe we were meant for each other..."
msgstr "也许我们天生一对……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000013
msgid "Nice pecs."
msgstr "胸肌不错。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000014
msgid "Take me to heaven, Snake."
msgstr "带我上天堂，SNAKE"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000017
msgid "Nice one!"
msgstr "干得好！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000018
msgid "Back at ya!"
msgstr "你也是"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000019
msgid "Try this one!"
msgstr "试试这招"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00001b
msgid "Nice shot!"
msgstr "好球！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00001c
msgid "OK, you win..."
msgstr "好吧，你赢了……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000021
msgid "Let me see that."
msgstr "让我看看。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000022
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000023
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000024
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001d
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001f
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000082
