msgstr "（占位，未使用）"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000029
msgid "I got...nothing...to hide..."
msgstr "我…没啥…好隐瞒…"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00002a
msgid "No skeletons...in my closet..."
msgstr "柜里…没骷髅…"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00002b
msgid "OK, OK...there's one thing...I never told you..."
msgstr "好吧…有件事…我没告诉过你…"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00002c
msgid "You were always...my..."
msgstr "你一直都是……我的……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00002e
msgid "Not even for you, Boss..."
msgstr "就算是你也不行，BOSS……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00002f
msgid "Snake...answer me, Snake...Snaaake!"
msgstr "SNAKE……回答我，SNAKE……SNAAAKE！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000030
msgid "Mom, your miso soup...always too salty..."
msgstr "妈，你味噌汤……总太咸……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000031
msgid "Dad...I'm an American..."
msgstr "爸……我是美国的……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000032
msgid "Stop it... I'm not that kind of guy..."
msgstr "住手……我不是那种人……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000033
msgid "Oh ho ho... Snake..."
msgstr "哦呵呵……SNAKE……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000035
msgid "What's you problem?"
msgstr "你有毛病？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000036
msgid "You looking to get punched?"
msgstr "想挨揍吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000039
msgid "Felt that one...!"
msgstr "中招了……！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003a
msgid "Where you going?"
msgstr "你去哪？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003b
msgid "Settle down, pal."
msgstr "冷静点，伙计。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003d
msgid "Nice shootin', Boss!"
msgstr "好枪法，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003e
msgid "I think I'm in love..."
msgstr "我想我恋爱了……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003f
msgid "Later, Snake. Now's not the time."
msgstr "回头见，SNAKE。现在不是时候。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000040
msgid ""
"Why don't we have a chat instead,\n"
"just the two of us?"
msgstr "不如我们聊聊天，\n就我们两个？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000041
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "好吧。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000042
msgid "OK, I get it."
msgstr "好，我明白了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000043
msgid "Yep. Our battle's just getting started."
msgstr "没错。我们的战斗才刚开始。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000044
msgid "That's right. We can do this!"
msgstr "对。我们能行！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000045
msgid "Not ready to quit yet!"
msgstr "还没打算放弃！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000046
msgid "Any time you're ready!"
msgstr "随时奉陪！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000047
msgid "Aww, Snake... You're gonna make me cry."
msgstr "哎呀，SNAKE……你要把我弄哭了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000048
msgid "I'm with you."
msgstr "我跟你。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000049
msgid "I'm not gonna die on you."
msgstr "我不会丢下你死。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004a
msgid "You too."
msgstr "你也是。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004b
msgid "Naturally."
msgstr "当然。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004c
msgid "Look who's talking."
msgstr "看看谁在说"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004d
msgid "Cut it out, you're making me blush."
msgstr "别说了，你让我脸红了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004e
msgid "Not a problem!"
msgstr "没问题！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00004f
msgid "You sure?"
msgstr "你确定？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000051
msgid "Not gonna happen."
msgstr "不可能。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000053
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000058
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006d
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000077
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "是啊"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000054
msgid "Right!"
msgstr "对！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000055
msgid "Lay off. There's nobody else around."
msgstr "别闹。周围没别人。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000056
msgid "But...why, Snake?"
msgstr "但是……为什么，SNAKE？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000057
msgid "I'm going with you, Boss."
msgstr "我跟你去，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000058
msgid "Glad to be with you, Boss..."
msgstr "很高兴和你在一起，BOSS……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000059
msgid "You sure know how to kill a guy..."
msgstr "你还真会打击人……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005a
msgid "I'm feeling your vibes, Boss!"
msgstr "我感受到你的气场了，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005b
msgid "I'm feeling it, Boss!"
msgstr "我感受到了，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005c
msgid "Watch this!"
msgstr "看这！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005d
msgid "Me too, Snake!"
msgstr "我也是，SNAKE！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005e
msgid "Meow? Meow meow...?"
msgstr "喵？喵喵……？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00005f
msgid "This is FANTASTIC!"
msgstr "这太棒了！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000060
msgid "Grub always tastes better when you're around."
msgstr "有你在，饭都更好吃了。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000061
msgid "OK, then, here I go!"
msgstr "好，我上了！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000062
msgid "Get better all the time!"
msgstr "越来越好了！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000063
msgid "Haidaraaaa!"
msgstr "嗨呀啦啦啦！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000065
msgid "You mean, in your arms?"
msgstr "你是说，在你怀里？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000066
msgid "You expect me to stay cool like this?"
msgstr "你想让我这样保持冷静？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000067
msgid "Yeah! I'm ready for some action!"
msgstr "好！我准备好大干一场了！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000068
msgid "Ha ha! Nature's telling us how badass we are!"
msgstr "哈哈！大自然都在说我们多厉害！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000069
msgid "That's just like you."
msgstr "真像你的风格。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006a
msgid "Arigato!"
msgstr "谢谢！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006b
msgid "I'm here."
msgstr "我在这。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006c
msgid "That's cold, Snake."
msgstr "太冷淡了，SNAKE。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006d
msgid "Haven't seen anybody."
msgstr "谁都没看到。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006e
msgid "I don't believe in luck."
msgstr "我不信运气。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00006f
msgid "Can't wait any longer!"
msgstr "等不下去了！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000070
msgid "No problems here."
msgstr "这边没事。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000073
msgid "C'mere!"
msgstr "过来！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000074
msgid "I can still do it!"
msgstr "我还能行！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000075
msgid "Good point..."
msgstr "有道理…"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000076
msgid "Hey, come on now, we're friends aren't we?"
msgstr "喂，别这样，我们是朋友吧？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000078
msgid "I know, it's crazy, isn't it?"
msgstr "我知道，很疯狂吧？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000079
msgid "What's wrong, Boss?"
msgstr "怎么了，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007a
msgid "We're just getting warmed up."
msgstr "我们才刚热身。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007b
msgid "Nothing like that around here."
msgstr "这附近没那种东西。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007c
msgid "You...you're kidding, right...?"
msgstr "你…你开玩笑吧…？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007d
msgid "Where?"
msgstr "哪里？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007e
msgid "I like you too."
msgstr "我也喜欢你。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00007f
msgid "Oh, right, I'm sure."
msgstr "哦对，我信。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000080
msgid "Nothing to it."
msgstr "小菜一碟"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000081
msgid "This isn't like you."
msgstr "这不像你。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000082
msgid "I'm always watching you..."
msgstr "我一直看着你……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000083
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "抱歉……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000084
msgid "You talking about me?"
msgstr "你是在说我吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000085
msgid "Any time!"
msgstr "随时奉陪！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000086
msgid "You're the boss, Boss."
msgstr "你是老大，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000088
msgid "I'm not running from this."
msgstr "我不逃避。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000089
msgid "Yeah, I...don't think we'd survive that."
msgstr "是啊，我……觉得活不下来。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00008a
msgid "Snake, you..."
msgstr "SNAKE，你……"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00008c
msgid "If they're not gonna come, leave 'em alone."
msgstr "他们不来就算了，别管他们。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00008d
msgid "We can't afford to do that, either way."
msgstr "不管怎样，我们都承担不起。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00008e
msgid "You're the Boss!"
msgstr "你是BOSS！"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00008f
msgid "Vos means you."
msgstr "Vos指的就是你。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000090
msgid "You do that."
msgstr "你去做吧。"

#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000091
msgid "MSF is the only family I've got."
msgstr "MSF是我唯一的家人。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000000
msgid "Room for one more?"
msgstr "还能再加一个人吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000007
msgid "I can't believe you."
msgstr "我真不敢相信你。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000008
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000009
msgid "You are going to take a picture of me?"
msgstr "你要给我拍照？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000a
msgid "I... never look good in photos..."
msgstr "我……拍照从来都不好看……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000b
msgid "I feel a little awkward... "
msgstr "我觉得有点尴尬……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000c
msgid "Hm? What is it?"
msgstr "嗯？怎么了？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000d
msgid "Cut it out."
msgstr "别闹。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000e
msgid "What are you looking at...?"
msgstr "你在看什么……？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00000f
msgid "What is wrong with you!"
msgstr "你怎么回事！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000011
msgid "What are you doing like that?!"
msgstr "你那样是在干什么？！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000012
msgid "Did you come here to swim? It is too dangerous."
msgstr "你是来游泳的吗？太危险了。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000013
msgid "Stay away from me."
msgstr "别靠近我。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000014
msgid "You've got...quite a body."
msgstr "身材……真不错。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000015
msgid "Do not come any closer."
msgstr "别再靠近了。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000016
msgid "Stay away. I am really not comfortable with this."
msgstr "走开。这样让我很不舒服。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001a
msgid "What's with that?"
msgstr "那算什么？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001b
msgid "You going to throw this away?"
msgstr "你要把这个扔掉？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00001c
msgid "You want to read this together?"
msgstr "想一起看这个吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000020
msgid "What are you thinking!"
msgstr "你在想什么！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000021
msgid "What are you staring at!"
msgstr "你在盯着什么看！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000022
msgid "Pervert!"
msgstr "变态"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000023
msgid "Creep!"
msgstr "色狼！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000024
msgid "Are you that desperate?"
msgstr "你就那么饥渴？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000025
msgid "Stop doing that, will you?"
msgstr "别这样了，行吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000029
msgid "I'm not... hiding anything from you..."
msgstr "我没……瞒着你什么……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002a
msgid "Honest. You have to believe me!"
msgstr "真的。你得相信我！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002b
msgid "My name is... Paz... I... I love peace..."
msgstr "我叫……帕兹……我……我爱和平……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002c
msgid "Honestly, I..."
msgstr "说实话，我……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002d
msgid "This hurts... Let me go..."
msgstr "好痛……放开我…"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002e
msgid "I... I stole some rations at Mother Base..."
msgstr "我……在母基地偷了口粮……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00002f
msgid "Snake... Please..."
msgstr "SNAKE……求你了……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000031
msgid "Mmmm... Mmm..."
msgstr "唔…唔…"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000032
msgid "Snake... You're..."
msgstr "SNAKE…你…"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000033
msgid "Gallo pinto..."
msgstr "豆饭……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000034
msgid "Yes, sir... I understand..."
msgstr "是，长官……我明白……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000035
msgid "Snake... Your beard hurts..."
msgstr "SNAKE…胡子扎人…"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000036
msgid "I said no..."
msgstr "我说了不行……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000039
msgid "Can you please stop that?"
msgstr "能不能别这样？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00003c
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "怎么了"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00003d
msgid "Where are you going?"
msgstr "你要去哪？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00003e
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "哇"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00003f
msgid "You're good."
msgstr "你厉害"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000040
msgid "Very cool..."
msgstr "太酷了……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000041
msgid "You know, we are finally alone, Snake..."
msgstr "我们终于独处了，SNAKE……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000042
msgid "Why don't you leave the radio alone for now?"
msgstr "先别管无线电了好吗？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000043
msgid "You don't want to talk to me?"
msgstr "你不想跟我说话？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000044
msgid "Heh... Thanks."
msgstr "嘿……谢谢。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000045
msgid "Yeah, OK."
msgstr "嗯，确定。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000046
msgid "I don't... want to go back just yet either..."
msgstr "我也……还不想回去……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000047
msgid "I want to... stay here together a little longer, too..."
msgstr "我也想……在这儿多待一会儿……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000048
msgid "Do it? Do what?"
msgstr "做？做什么？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004a
msgid "What? No way..."
msgstr "什么？不会吧……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004b
msgid "Huh? What do you mean...?"
msgstr "咦？啥意思……？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004c
msgid "Thanks. Peace!"
msgstr "谢了。和平！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004d
msgid "Yeah, I am alright."
msgstr "嗯，我没事。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004e
msgid "I don't know about that..."
msgstr "这我可说不准……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00004f
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr "当然！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000050
msgid "Thanks. Peace."
msgstr "谢了。和平。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000051
msgid "Really? Oh, I'm so happy!"
msgstr "真的？我好开心！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000052
msgid "What is it, Snake?"
msgstr "怎么了，SNAKE"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000053
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000067
msgid "I am not sleepy."
msgstr "我不困。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000054
msgid "Good night..."
msgstr "晚安……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000055
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "哦"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000057
msgid "What am I going to do with you..."
msgstr "我该拿你怎么办……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000059
msgid "That is true."
msgstr "确实。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005a
msgid "I am here, too."
msgstr "我也在。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005b
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000061
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr "嗯"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005c
msgid "What?! The enemy?! Where?!"
msgstr "什么？！敌人？！在哪？！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005e
msgid "Sí. Thanks."
msgstr "谢了。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005f
msgid "What? Why...?"
msgstr "什么？为什么……？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000062
msgid "Meow? Meow meow meow...?"
msgstr "喵？喵喵喵……？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000063
msgid "Sí, so delicious."
msgstr "是，太好吃了。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000064
msgid "You do not like being with me...?"
msgstr "你不喜欢跟我一起？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000068
msgid "Wow... You are all fired up, huh!"
msgstr "哇……你干劲十足啊！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000069
msgid "Aaah! Lightning!"
msgstr "啊！打雷！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006a
msgid "What is that cover for?"
msgstr "那掩护干嘛的？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006c
msgid "Congratulations."
msgstr "恭喜。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006e
msgid "Over already?"
msgstr "结束了？"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006f
msgid "I am sorry..."
msgstr "抱歉……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000070
msgid "No, it is OK."
msgstr "不，没关系。"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000071
msgid "Hehe... I am so happy..."
msgstr "嘿嘿……我好开心……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000072
msgid "Yeeeah... I don't think so..."
msgstr "呃……我看不行……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000074
msgid "Okie-doke!"
msgstr "好嘞！"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000075
msgid "What? It is nothing..."
msgstr "啥？没事……"

#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000076
msgid "What is it? You OK?"
msgstr "怎么了？你没事吧？"
